      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COMPARE BUBBLE (1) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 4.5 lengths second (22.99) over 400m at Geelong. Sure to be about the mark. PAW AMALFI (2) has mixed form recently, finishing fourth (30.93) in a Grade 5 at The Meadows latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Rates a winning chance on best. GO STEVIE (8) has a moderate overall strike-rate. Better run when finding the frame last time though, finishing third (23.09) at Warragul. Has a good record here at this journey. Hard to beat again. BUNNI BALE (6) did a good job to finish third last time out over 400m at Geelong (22.79) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
